Subject: [PATCH] fix(skills): make forge clean + doc-gate routable
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Round-3 review (Codex): coverage.json maps these commands (correctly — the new
skills own them) but the deterministic router had no cue, so forge skill for
could not reach them.
- using-forge.js: worktree gains 'forge clean' anchor; gates gains 'doc-gate' /
  'forge doc-gate' anchors. Specific command literals, no over-match.
- verified forge clean -> worktree, doc-gate/forge doc-gate -> gates, while
  'run validation in this worktree' still routes away. Regen worktree/gates
  scorecards; .agents synced by hook.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 lib/using-forge.js | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

